00:33:36.210 --> 00:33:39.740
First, a knife hand strike, and
then afterwards a Yoko Gari,

00:33:39.740 --> 00:33:42.059
which is a sidekick
to break some boards.

00:34:28.466 --> 00:34:32.458
FELD: [VOCALIZES]

00:34:32.458 --> 00:34:35.452
[APPLAUSE]

00:34:43.010 --> 00:34:45.929
FELD: [INAUDIBLE]
break some concrete.

00:34:45.929 --> 00:34:49.469
And David is going to
demonstrate first a wheel kick

00:34:49.469 --> 00:34:52.219
and then a hammer fist
This wheel technique

00:34:52.219 --> 00:34:54.049
is a very powerful technique.

00:35:30.975 --> 00:35:37.961
FELD: [VOCALIZES] Hyah!

00:35:37.961 --> 00:35:40.955
[APPLAUSE]

